## Context

After 0729 establishes a defensible causal design, build and analyse the observations required by that design. Reuse the CRS pipeline 0713 and reconciliation 0721; lender histories complement rather than silently replace those data.

Plan: `conception/jetp-observatory-and-papers-plan.md`. Parent tracker: 0725.

## First test

First failing analysis fixture: an unfinished project, a cancelled project, an interval-dated approval and a mature project relabelled JETP. Milestone-attainment estimates must retain at-risk observations, distinguish cancellation from ordinary censoring, respect date uncertainty and avoid restarting the project clock at relabelling.

## Actions

Freeze the pilot-approved cohort protocol before estimating effects. Extract source-linked dated histories and choose matching/stratification by country, lender, instrument and technology as sample support permits. Separate financial operations/tranches from project histories. Produce risk sets, sample counts, missingness and milestone-attainment/duration comparisons with uncertainty. Test sensitivity to maturity on entry, period composition and attribution. Keep post-signature execution distinct from pre-approval selection. If 0729 defers causal identification, stop primary effect estimation and return the scope decision to the author. A coverage result may document the blockage but does not complete the causal short-paper analysis.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Frozen cohort and matching rules with reproducible source-linked data
- [ ] Missing, censored, cancelled and interval-dated observations handled explicitly
- [ ] Stage comparisons report sample support, uncertainty and sensitivity
- [ ] No unsupported causal JETP-effect claim or completed-only comparison
- [ ] Analysis artifacts tied to a frozen release and ready for 0732

## Validation

Apply the repository gates for the actual diff. Code work starts with the failing
fixture above; prose/data work records the documentary acceptance check. Preserve
source evidence and report limits rather than manufacturing a successful result.

## Storage implementation contract

Keep historical comparator observations separate from the JETP portfolio and version their inputs. Intermediate analysis or optional SQLite exports belong under `data/derived/jetp/`; they are regenerable and never editable authorities.

